+  1 p5_rescore_seat_king.py  on the ORIGINAL state copy   -> aux.p5.json (prev_rec.legz.king only) + leg_returns_live.rescored.json
+  2 p1_build_ema_v0.py       on aux.p5.json               -> aux.with_ema_v0.json (adds ema_v0)
+  3 fund_label_ema_correction.py --classes D17,P9 --zip-dir <monthly zips>  on aux.with_ema_v0.json -> aux.corrected.json (ema acc, tail labels)
+P5 must run first: it replays the producer with the stored labels and asserts they agree across sources, so it cannot read corrected labels.
+This check refuses (rc 2, no STAGED output) unless: the receipt sha chain is closed; every aux field outside {ema.acc, ledger_tail labels,
+ema_v0, prev_rec.legz.king} is equal to the original; ema acc moves exactly by the correction receipt's per-name dacc and on no other name;
+labels change exactly on the APPLIED in-tail corrections; ema_v0 passes the code's ema_v0_problems; leg returns change only on the king
+rows P5 rescored. On PASS it writes <out>/STAGED/{aux.json, leg_returns_live.json} and SHA256SUMS for the install step.
+Usage: python3 -B swap_state_compose_check.py --orig STATE_DIR --p5 DIR --p1 DIR --corr DIR --code DIR --out DIR"""
